<title>GERMANY: Allianz eyes rise in industrial insurance.</title>
<headline>Allianz eyes rise in industrial insurance.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurance giant Allianz AG Holding said on Wednesday that it expected its industrial insurance business could grow by 50 percent in the next three years.</p>
<p>The group told its shareholders the industrial business could grow to three billion marks ($1.8 billion) from two billion marks by the year 2000.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.702 German Marks)</p>
